flowchart TB
    Operator["Local operator<br/>[Person]<br/>Runs tools and chooses completed records"]
    subgraph ADCP[Agent Delegation Control Plane — local workstation]
      Server["Static server<br/>[Container: Python]<br/>Loopback assets only, no writes"]
      Viewer["Investigation viewer<br/>[Container: browser JavaScript]<br/>Intake, evaluation and evidence UI"]
      Saved[("Saved investigations and regression reviews<br/>[Data store: browser localStorage]<br/>Origin-scoped, bounded evidence and review notes")]
      Viewer <-->|Save, revalidate and remove / local only| Saved
      Runner["Optional agent runner<br/>[Container: Python / Agents SDK]<br/>Three agents, fixed tools, capture"]
      Experiment["Controlled experiment<br/>[Container: Node.js]<br/>Scripted reads/export and negative cases"]
      Pilot["Optional coding pilot<br/>[Container: Python / Agents SDK]<br/>Runtime pilot policy, capture and independent grading"]
      Sandbox["Disposable execution sandbox<br/>[Container: Docker / Python]<br/>No host mounts or network; bounded resources and workspace"]
      Files[("Run artifacts<br/>[Data store: local files]<br/>SDK investigation; controlled normalized input; raw evidence")]
      Key[("Ignored credential config<br/>[Configuration: .env.local]<br/>API key; unavailable to viewer/server")]
      Viewer -->|Loads listed assets / loopback HTTP| Server
      Viewer -->|Reads user-selected SDK investigation.json / File API| Files
      Runner -->|Writes new run artifacts| Files
      Experiment -->|Writes separate run artifacts| Files
      Runner -->|Reads approved key| Key
      Pilot -->|Reads approved key in trusted host process| Key
      Pilot -->|Python and fictional CSV only| Sandbox
      Sandbox -->|Bounded physical output and exit status| Pilot
      Pilot -->|Writes private receipts and completed investigation| Files
    end
    OpenAI["OpenAI API<br/>[External software system]<br/>Optional model provider"]
    Operator -->|Starts and inspects| Viewer
    Operator -->|Starts optional run| Runner
    Operator -->|Starts scripted scenarios| Experiment
    Operator -->|Starts explicit offline or live pilot| Pilot
    Runner <-->|Fictional tasks and model responses / HTTPS| OpenAI
    Pilot <-->|Fictional task and model responses / HTTPS| OpenAI
    classDef person fill:#123e68,stroke:#123e68,color:#fff
    classDef container fill:#eaf2fc,stroke:#325e91,color:#132d4b
    classDef data fill:#f5f7fa,stroke:#66788c,color:#132d4b
    class Operator person
    class Server,Viewer,Runner,Experiment,Pilot,Sandbox container
    class Files,Key,OpenAI,Saved data
